\par + L\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh doanh c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f v\'e0 c\'f3 c\'f4ng t\'e1c qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd T\'e0i ch\'ednh ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7879\'3f t
\u7889\'3ft.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af76\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 + C\'f3 h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7841\'3fi l\'fd k\'fd tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par - Cu\u7889\'3fi m\u7895\'3fi ng\'e0y \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd ph\u7843\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu b\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh
\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7899\'3fc. Cu\u7889\'3fi m\u7895\'3fi \'f0\u7907\'3ft ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 c\'f5 quan \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af76\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh l\'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 15.3. Ph\'e1t h\'e0nh theo ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7845\'3fu th\u7847\'3fu theo quy ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7845\'3fu th\u7847\'3fu do B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh q
uy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh (c\'f3 v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn ri\'eang).
\par 16. Ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc
\par 16.1 Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thanh to\'e1n m\u7897\'3ft l\u7847\'3fn khi \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn:
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu thanh to\'e1n tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\u7841\'3fn s\u7869\'3f do doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc xem x\'e9t quy\u7871\'3ft 
\'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn thanh to\'e1n g\u7889\'3fc, ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng \'f0
\u7871\'3fn thanh to\'e1n, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo l\'fdu s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc, nh\'fdng kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i trong th\u7901\'3fi gian b\u7843\'3fo l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fdu.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 16.2. Ti\u7873\'3fn l\'e3i tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thanh to\'e1
n theo ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc sau:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - Thanh to\'e1n ngay khi ph\'e1t h\'e0nh (c\'f2n g\u7885\'3fi l\'e0 tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu chi\u7871\'3ft kh\u7845\'3fu): Thay v\'ec tr\u7843\'3f l\'e3i khi }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn, tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\'e1n th\u7845\'3fp h\'f5n m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 (t\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'fd\'f5ng v\u7899\'3fi kho\u7843
\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng) v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ho
\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f b\u7857\'3fng m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 khi \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn thanh to\'e1n.
\par - Thanh to\'e1n theo \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f: 6 th\'e1ng ho\u7863\'3fc 12 th\'e1ng m\u7897\'3ft l\u7847\'3fn tu\u7923\'3f theo t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7907\'3ft ph\'e1t h\'e0nh.
\par - Thanh  to\'e1n m\u7897\'3ft l\u7847\'3fn khi \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par N\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn thanh to\'e1n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i m\'e0 ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fda \'f0\u7871\'3fn thanh to\'e1n th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'ec s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'e3i }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'f3 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo l\'fdu \'f0\u7875\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174  ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f khi ch\u7911\'3f s
\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 nhu c\u7847\'3fu, kh\'f4ng t\'ednh l\'e3i nh\u7853\'3fp v\'e0o v\u7889\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 16.3. Ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc v\'e0 l\'e3i tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f
c thanh to\'e1n t\u7841\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f5 quan \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 .
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f5 quan \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu chuy\u7875\'3fn to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc, l\'e3i theo }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ch\u7881\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn do ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp ph\'ed chuy\u7875\'3fn ti
\u7873\'3fn t\'ednh theo m\u7913\'3fc ph\'ed thanh to\'e1n qua Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng (n\u7871\'3fu b\u7857\'3fng chuy\u7875\'3fn kho\u7843\'3fn) v\'e0 m\u7913\'3fc ph\'ed chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn qua b\'fdu \'f0i\u7879\'3fn (n\u7871\'3fu b\u7857\'3fng ti
\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft).
\par -Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 Vi\u7879\'3ft ki\u7873\'3fu, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i mu\u7889\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7893\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc t\u7915
\'3f \'f0\u7891\'3fng Vi\u7879\'3ft nam sang ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174  l\'fd ngo\u7841\'3fi h\u7889\'3fi v\'e0 quy }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7893\'3fi ngo\u7841\'3f
i t\u7879\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Vi\u7879\'3ft nam .
\par 17. To\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af76\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd, s\u7917\'3f d\u7909
\'3fng theo \'f0\'fang m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch d\u7921\'3f \'e1n \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft theo c\'f5 ch\u7871\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd T\'e0i ch\'ednh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 ch\u7883\'3fu s\u7921\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm tra, ki\u7875\'3fm so\'e1t c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 18. Ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7845\'3fy t\u7915\'3f kh\u7845
\'3fu hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd b\u7857\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu, sau khi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ngh\u297\'69}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 a v\u7909\'3f n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f cho Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd
\u7899\'3fc theo lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par - Ngo\'e0i ngu\u7891\'3fn thu n\'f3i tr\'ean, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi qu\u7929\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p kh\'e1c \'f0
\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n nh\'fd v\u7889\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn thu\u7897\'3fc c\'e1c t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, qu\u7929\'3f kuy\u7871
\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc; kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871
\'3fu m\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn.
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng h\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn k\u7875\'3f tr\'ean v\u7851\'3fn kh\'f4ng }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7911\'3f thanh to\'e1n th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'ec t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo l\'e3nh c
\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, \'f0
\'fang h\u7841\'3fn c\u7843\'3f g\u7889\'3fc v\'e0 l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i cho ng}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7901\'3fi s
\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu. Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn do t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3nh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 \u7913\'3f
ng chi tr\u7843\'3f.
\par 19. Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc, l\'e3i v\'e0 chi ph\'ed ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 u doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh v
\'e0o gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd b\u7857\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par Chi ph\'ed ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par + Chi ph\'ed in \u7845\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 c\'e1c \u7845\'3fn ch\u7881\'3f c\'f3 li\'ean quan.
\par + Chi ph\'ed ph\'e1t h\'e0nh v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a b\u7857\'3fng 0,5% tr\'ean doanh s\u7889\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh; trong \'f0\'f3 hoa h\u7891\'3fng cho c\'e1c \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af76\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a b\u7857\'3fng 0,25% tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'ean  t\u7893\'3fng gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f tr\'e1
i phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 b\'e1n.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5706373 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 II- C\u7892\'3f PHI\u7870
