\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 1. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc l\'e0 ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f th\u7915\'3fa nh\u7853\'3fn s\u7921\'3f g\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn v\'e0 quy
\u7873\'3fn s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu v\u7873\'3f v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu do doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh nh\u7857\'3fm g\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn v\'e0
o doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc g\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc m\u7899\'3fi m\'e0 Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc l\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi s\'e1ng l\u7853\'3fp.

\par 2. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc bao g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd danh v\'e0 v}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f4 danh:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu k\'fd danh l\'e0 lo\u7841\'3fi c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 ghi t\'ean ng}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7901\'3fi mua tr\'ean ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa th\'e0nh vi\'ean h\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f v\'e0 nh
\u7919\'3fng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi s\'e1ng l\u7853\'3fp ra doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi l\'e0 c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd danh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu v\'f4 danh l\'e0 lo\u7841\'3fi c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng ghi t\'ean ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi mua tr\'ean ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f c
\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu, nh\'fdng ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\'e3ng k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd t\'ean t\u7841\'3fi doanh nghi
\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f theo d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f5i v\'e0 thanh to\'e1
n l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc  c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 3. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh d\'fd\u7899\'3fi d\u7841\'3fng ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f
. Ch\u7913\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc do B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh (C\u7909\'3fc  Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc) quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7851\'3fu, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3f
c in, qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd v\'e0 chuy\u7875\'3fn cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 
\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh.
\par 4. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa m\u7895\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ch\u7881\'3f c\'f3 m\u7897\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1, do doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh sau khi \'f0}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh ch\u7845\'3fp thu\u7853\'3fn. M
\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 100.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng Vi\u7879\'3ft nam .
\par 5. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi b\u7857\'3fng \'f0\u7891\'3fng Vi\u7879\'3ft nam.Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu b\u7857\'3fng v\'e0ng ho\u7863\'3fc ngo
\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7893\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan ph\'e1t h\'e0nh thu v\'e0ng v\'e0 ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7893\'3fi ra \'f0\u7891\'3fng Vi\u7879\'3ft nam nh
\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7873\'3fu 6, ph\u7847\'3fn I n\'f3i tr\'ean.
\par 6. L\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thanh to\'e1n h\'e0ng n\'e3m v\'e0o cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m T\'e0i ch\'ednh quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, tu\u7923\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc v\'e0o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845
\'3ft kinh doanh v\'e0 theo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par 7. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\'e1n cho c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7873\'3fu 8.1, ph\u7847\'3fn I c\u7911\'3fa Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.

\par - M\u7895\'3fi c\u7893\'3f \'f0\'f4ng c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mua m\u7897\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc nhi\u7873\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu, nh\'fdng kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p v\'fd\u7907\'3ft qu\'e1 5% t\u7893\'3fng gi\'e1 tr\u7883
\'3f c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu ph\'e1t h\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi th\u7875\'3f nh\'e2n v\'e0 10% t\u7893\'3fng gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ph\'e1p nh\'e2n.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng th\'fd\'f5ng m\u7841\'3fi, C\'f4ng ty T\'e0i ch\'ednh, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng, c\'f4ng ty b\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm, qu\u7929\'3f b
\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm, qu\u7929\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1c qu\u7929\'3f h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p v\'e0 ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung \'f0\u7875\'3f mua c\u7893\'3f phi
\u7871\'3fu. Vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd T\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp (B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd, S\u7903\'3f T
\'e0i ch\'ednh - V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp thu\u7897\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c h\u7897\'3fi v\'e0 \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f qu\u7847\'3fn ch\'fang \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi qu\u7929\'3f h
\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p c\u7911\'3fa m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\u7875\'3f mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871
\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par - C\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng theo Lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 gi\u7845
\'3fy \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc k\'e8m theo b\u7843\'3fn sao gi\u7845\'3fy ph\'e9p \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd g\u7917\'3fi cho B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f xem x\'e9
t, ch\u7845\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par - Nghi\'eam c\u7845\'3fm c\'e1c c\'f5 quan Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f trang, c\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f x}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi s
\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f mua c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par 8. C\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7921\'3f do mua b\'e1n, chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng, th\u7915\'3fa k\u7871\'3f. Vi\u7879\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng quy\u7873\'3fn s
\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af76\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd danh, v\'f4 danh \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc n\'f5i ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu, kh\'f4ng m\u7845\'3ft ph\'ed.
\par  Kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f thay th\u7871\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn trong l\'fdu th\'f4ng, n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f cho Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 kh\'f4ng \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng l\'e0m t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn th\u7871\'3f ch\u7845\'3fp trong c\'e1c quan h\u7879\'3f t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 9. Vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd, giao nh\u7853\'3fn, v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn v\'e0 b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3f
p Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nh\'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft v\'e0 c\'e1c \u7845\'3fn ch\u7881
\'3f c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f.
\par - C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, c\'e1 nh\'e2n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc n\u7871\'3fu l\'e0m m\u7845\'3ft, h\'fd h\u7887\'3fng t\u7901\'3f c
\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm b\u7891\'3fi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh v\'e0 b\u7883\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af76\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f76\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'fd k\u7927\'3f lu\u7853\'3ft tu\u7923\'3f theo m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f vi ph\u7841\'3fm .
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 - Ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu nh\'fd ti\u7873\'3f
n. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp b\u7883\'3f m\u7845\'3ft c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi b\'e1o ngay cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7875\'3f c\'f3 bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p gi
\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f g\u7917\'3fi t\u7901\'3f c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu t\u7841\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng th\'fd\'f5ng m\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3f
i n\u7897\'3fp m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fn ph\'ed b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng 0,1% tr\'ean t\u7893\'3fng m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par 10. Quy\u7873\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi v\'e0 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu :
\par - \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu cho c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 c\'e1 nh\'e2n trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Lu\u7853\'3f
t c\'f4ng ty v\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par - \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh theo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911
\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
