\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 a l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn theo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par 11. \'d0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu :
\par 11.1. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng :
\par - \'d0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp gi\u7845\'3fy ch\u7913\'3fng nh\u7853
