\par - C\'f3 d\u7921\'3f \'e1n ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, t\u7893\'3fng m\u7913\'3fc m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu d\u7921\'3f ki\u7871
\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc v\'fd\u7907\'3ft qu\'e1 70% gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 l\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par 11.2. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp m\u7899\'3fi :
\par - Ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par - V\u7889\'3fn c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc chi\u7871\'3fm kh\'f4ng d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 30% t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par - T\u7893\'3fng m\u7913\'3fc c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu d\u7921\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh kh\'f4ng v\'fd\u7907\'3ft qu\'e1 v\u7889\'3fn ph\'e1p \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ban \'f0\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ghi trong \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l
\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par 12. C\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc mu\u7889\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi g\u7917\'3fi \'f0\u7871\'3fn B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'e1c h\u7891\'3f s\'f5 sau \'f0\'e2y :
\par - \'d0\'f5n xin ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu theo m\u7851\'3fu quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh .
\par - \'d0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par - \'d0\u7873\'3f \'e1n s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh ho\u7863\'3fc lu\u7853\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par - C\'e1c b\'e1o c\'e1o T\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7911\'3fa 3 n\'e3m g\u7847\'3fn nh\u7845\'3ft tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi xin ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng bao g
\u7891\'3fm : B\u7843\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng k\u7871\'3ft t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn, b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft  kinh doanh, b\'e1o c\'e1o c\'f4ng n\u7907\'3f c\'f3 x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan ki\u7875\'3f
m to\'e1n ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par - Ph\'fd\'f5ng \'e1n ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc bao g\u7891\'3fm : m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng, t\u7893\'3fng m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn d\u7921\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0
nh, m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1 c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu s\u7869\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, d\u7921\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c\u7893\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn h\'e0ng n\'e3
m, ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par 13. Trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi 45 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y nh\u7853\'3fn h\u7891\'3f s\'f5, B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh xem x\'e9t ra quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu. Quy
