\par Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (ho\u7863\'3fc H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f l\'e2m th\u7901\'3fi \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc m\u7899\'3fi th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp) ph
\u7843\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc 7 ng\'e0y tr\'ean c\'e1c ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn th\'f4ng tin \'f0\u7841\'3fi ch\'fang c\'e1c n\u7897\'3fi dung c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu nh
\'fd : m\u7913\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, m\u7879\'3fnh gi\'e1, th\u7901\'3fi gian, \'f0\u7883\'3fa \'f0i\u7875\'3fm ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, quy\u7873\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu, c\'e1
c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh kh\'e1c c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 15. Vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo hai ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc: ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp t\u7841\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ho
