\u7883\'3fa ch\u7881\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn do ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu.
\par 17. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ch\u7911\'3f s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 Vi\u7879\'3ft ki\u7873\'3fu, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i mu\u7889\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7893\'3fi l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c
