 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 2.2. Ban h\'e0nh c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f th\u7871\'3f ch\u7845\'3fp, c\u7847\'3fm c\u7889\'3f tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc trong c\'e1c quan h\u7879\'3f t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng.
\par 2.3. Ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh trong vi\u7879\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af78\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f78\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13702230\charrsid3043174 \'e3i su\u7845\'3ft tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi
