\par 3.2. Duy\u7879\'3ft to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f h\u7891\'3f s\'f5 xin ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu, c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc g\u7917\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
