u, c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 4. C\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\'e1i phi\u7871\'3fu, c\u7893\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm :
